LAMMPS (29 Aug 2024)
OMP_NUM_THREADS environment is not set. Defaulting to 1 thread. (src/comm.cpp:98)
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
# ============================================================
# 7000 ps (7 ns) NVT continuation (KH560 system)
# Inherits velocities from nvt_3000ps.data (Velocities section)
# Input : nvt_3000ps.data (equilibrated 300 K, periodic ppp)
# Output: current working directory
# CPU version (no GPU package required)
# ============================================================

units           real
atom_style      full
boundary        p p p

pair_style      lj/class2/coul/long 15.5
bond_style      class2
angle_style     class2
dihedral_style  class2
improper_style  class2
special_bonds   lj/coul 0 0 1
kspace_style    pppm 1e-4

# Read the final data file from the previous stage
# (coordinates AND velocities are loaded automatically -> velocities inherited)
read_data       nvt_3000ps.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (-25.670328 -31.5634 -24.895714) to (32.337956 26.966229 32.307775)
  4 by 4 by 2 MPI processor grid
